OL,3,ATrump hits out at US central bank's
OL,4,Adecision to hike interest rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US central bank raises interest
OL,7,Frates for the first time in three years
OL,8,Ffrom 3.5%-3.75% to 3.75%-4%
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump hits out at the
OL,11,Fdecision and calls again for the Fed to
OL,12,Flower rates "and fast!" - but the one
OL,13,Fsenior Democrat says the president will
OL,14,F"blame anyone but himself for this rate
OL,15,Fhike"
OL,17,FFed chairman Kevin Warsh says: "The
OL,18,Fplain fact is inflation is too high,
OL,19,Fand has been for too long"
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
